ved_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-05-24T01:38:27Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T14:44:07Z","closed_at":"2026-06-02T14:44:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n**Discovered in 4.6.3**, found relevant code to be unchanged since then as of [fa6cad2](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/fa6cad230f638d65a5a897008c5fc512edc237ad)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8157) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11700 @ 2.50GHz (16 threads) - 31.81 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nRecently support for Stacked Shadows was added. They seemingly offer the same functionality as the preexisting Shadow.\n\n<img height=\"400\" width=\"400\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7aedf995-4a2c-41c7-a401-9106d18cf315\" />\n\nI believe there was a small mistake made when implementing this feature:\nWhile the offset of each stacked shadow is exposed as a Vector2, internally they are saved (thus [cast](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/fa6cad230f638d65a5a897008c5fc512edc237ad/scene/resources/label_settings.cpp#L365)) into a Vector2i.\n```gd\nstruct StackedShadowData {\n\tVector2i offset = Vector2i(1, 1);\n\tColor color;\n\tint32_t outline_size = 0;\n};\n```\n\nThis is quite troublesome when trying to smoothly and precisely adjust these shadows, but also super easy to miss, it took me like an hour to finally get whats going on.\n\nI am not 100% sure if its that easy, but my suggested fix would literally be replacing the two Vector2i occurrences in ([label_settings.h](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/fa6cad230f638d65a5a897008c5fc512edc237ad/scene/resources/label_settings.h#L48)) with Vector2's.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create `LabelSettings` Resource\n2. Attempt setting `stacked_shadow_0:Vector2` to any Vector2\n3. See it being cast back to a Vector2i, but still display as a Vector2\n\n<img width=\"575\" height=\"193\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f0139c47-c35c-4e96-984f-e60b9b1a5a4e\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp-label-settings-stacked-shadow-offset.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28185835/mrp-label-settings-stacked-shadow-offset.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119699/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119699/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}